{
  "bodyHash": "ed576f6ab7e52d0e",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>О моде</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Этот мод добавляет в игру всего 25 новых мечей с уникальными способностями и материалами!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Содержимое</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Материалы</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f7101135-5f55-4997-b5a0-2dfc4c90c6e7.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Расплавленный слиток</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_10ad1e70-303e-480f-909b-c0b307592a52.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Слиток шалкера</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8ed56d1f-266c-40e2-b441-236b8066b40a.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Тройной стержень</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d7631a2-34b9-4e7c-b249-278208c4f3ea.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Прекрасная звезда</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9fea426f-8262-4177-82d6-1ea88cc718a1.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Расплавленный обсидиан</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_333ab06d-d246-45fc-8b7c-7447a0524baf.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Эхорит</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_74dbca33-0b8d-4340-a62e-8a19f81137cf.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Призма</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_026a7225-9a95-4ea4-b6c1-736837ca3515.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Призматический слиток</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7b9ebc8b-16c4-44cc-bad5-4fd2d872a59f.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Слиток зла</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2610f703-8185-4137-8bf8-9b47217dd7e3.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Ядро зла</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Мечи</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Некоторые мечи обладают особыми способностями, но я не буду описывать их здесь, чтобы избежать спойлеров.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_07da992a-46f3-4821-a498-0581209bbfa8.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Расплавленный меч</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f44f8dc1-40a3-4b8a-9b98-c7373b389301.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч шалкера</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_040474d3-e01e-4d54-a8d7-e7c9e69db3b4.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Смоляной меч</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d4b9da0-cc86-4091-80ee-1694dd50488c.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Ледяное лезвие</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fca059c4-3b4b-4a12-b55d-f52e010e6d5e.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч удачи</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_35c41184-d33b-4d00-aa8f-32b8c2af7a73.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Костяной меч</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ac439151-921c-46ce-b517-a7d85b6346da.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч из красного гриба</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_64eb69f7-060a-4c18-a704-b4940b93974f.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч из коричневого гриба</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cdba9033-ffb7-4eed-8ecc-6bfef366cdcc.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Аметистовый меч</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ccab7e72-749b-45a3-988a-047825b55b28.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч-палка</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cff25e3d-fa44-42a3-8250-523af05bc2c0.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч из розы</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f467aff6-905e-46f5-9d74-519898310fe7.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч из земли (любой)</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2ffb25cb-8a13-4004-996d-8eec2584ae1a.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Лезвие из слайма</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b7729ff4-c66c-44ee-b39f-838965165aba.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч героя</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3285be15-c411-450e-b56f-885b3b9d99b9.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Ветряное лезвие</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_15647896-7bb9-4e0f-9ec1-210f15a85d91.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч-поршень</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_403a8415-744e-4b70-a344-b96021f27e1d.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч огненных душ</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_46a2eae3-1995-402e-b99d-dbbe6098409e.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Позолоченный меч</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_27e7ff57-72ad-4d0f-9bf2-0b0452534233.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Обсидиановое лезвие</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8c9f0448-e202-4ac9-9385-85f283cff698.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч из эхорита</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6e0cf082-7a19-4efc-998b-e2ca9554a167.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч зла</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45e6f725-4fcf-490c-8bef-2a1f84d775e5.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Призматический меч</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_29bad277-49cb-4852-b2e9-4b161032d9e9.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч из бедрока (если получится)</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f7cb3750-978a-44ae-991c-fd26d6a60d5a.png\"></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Меч творческого режима (без рецепта крафта)</em></p>",
